{
  "_note": "Level 1-2 beats 1 to 4 (LVL-02b) and beats 6 to 9 (LVL-02c) from design/levels/LEVEL-1-2.md: the open service corridor with the empty B02 plinth, the parry corridor (one Roamer alone, its own one wave arena), the yard, the Ring arena (A2: two waves of Roamers, the north exit a reveal), the breather store, then the connecting corridor with the empty tower bay (beat 5, a later card: a _note marks it), the Crossroads arena (A7 scaled: hub, centre pillar with four foam skins, four spokes), breather 2 with marked empty spots where the U2 station and the S3 ledge will go ([Paul], not built), the tiered bowl gauntlet (A3 scaled: tiers at 0, 1.2 and 2.4 m reached by walkable ramps, rifts on the upper tier, four foam pillars on tier 1, ammo in both bottom corners; the floor island that drops is a later card, no falling floor exists yet) and the lit 4 m exit door on the far wall with the level's exit pad behind it. The path runs north: the player starts in the south corridor at y 0 and walks to -z. One floor, one ceiling and a perimeter wall enclose the level; the rooms are the open spaces between walls and the pinches between them are the arena doors. The B02 rack is [Paul] (B02 is not built): the plinth stands empty with a foam-yellow marking. Names, setting and the accent colour are [Paul]. Metres, Y up, positions are box centres, sizes are full extents. Tuning numbers (wave gaps and holds) live here, not in code.",
